        "releaseDate": null,
        "description": "Field extractions, sourcetypes, and CIM tagging for Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) logs pushed via Splunk HTTP Event Collector from an OCI Function, plus a native modular input for pulling directly from OCI Streaming via API key auth. Replacement for the archived Splunk Addon for OCI (Splunkbase app 5222) and Splunk Cloud Addon for OCI (app 7021), which are incompatible with Splunk 9.3+/10.",
